        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 1: $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 状态",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            383,
            156
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/1720db0695ddb7d548204fcf2ee6dc1059efb2e79589b09991d519f2b9701c05.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            401,
            167,
            589,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义及物理意义",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            249,
            346,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由于激励信号的作用, 响应 $r(t)$ 及其各阶导数有可能在 $t = 0$ 时刻发生跳变, 为区分跳变前后的状态, 以 $0_{-}$ 表示激励接入之前的瞬时, 以 $0_{+}$ 表示激励接入以后的瞬时。与此对应, 给出 $0_{-}$ 时刻和 $0_{+}$ 时刻的两组状态, 即",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            273,
            811,
            339
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) = \\left[ r (0 _ {-}), \\frac {d r (0 _ {-})}{d t}, \\dots , \\frac {d ^ {n - 1} r (0 _ {-})}{d t ^ {n - 1}} \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            315,
            345,
            678,
            382
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "称这组状态为“0\\_状态”或“起始状态”。它包含了为计算未来响应所需要的过去全部信息。另一组状态是",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            388,
            810,
            429
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+}) = \\left[ r (0 _ {+}), \\frac {d r (0 _ {+})}{d t}, \\dots , \\frac {d ^ {n - 1} r (0 _ {+})}{d t ^ {n - 1}} \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            315,
            435,
            678,
            473
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "这组状态被称为“0+状态”或“初始状态”，也可称为“导出的起始状态”。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            480,
            727,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、响应区间",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            504,
            292,
            519
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "用时域经典法求得微分方程的响应具体限于 $0_{+}<t<\\infty$ 的时间范围。根据 $0_{+}$ 状态的数据求得完全响应中的待定系数。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            528,
            811,
            570
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、连续时间系统经典法求解系统响应的完整流程：",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            600,
            586,
            616
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/f0fb363f5d83f0652a4ee8074ab66ae6809a5593f506b363a019923789cac079.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            329,
            625,
            660,
            801
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "学习目标: (1) 跳不? (2) 跳多少?",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            806,
            519,
            823
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
