    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 2: 冲激函数匹配法",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            109,
            418,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、 $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 发生跳变的判断方法：将激励带入到方程右端，化简得自由项，若自由项中包含 $\\delta(t)$ 或 $\\delta(t)$ 的各阶导数，则 $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 发生跳变。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            137,
            808,
            179
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "否则未发生跳变，即 $0_{-}$ 状态的值等于 $0_{+}$ 状态的值。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            188,
            581,
            204
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例8：已知 $\\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + 2r(t) = e(t), r(0_{-}) = 1, e(t) = u(t)$ ，求 $r(0_{+})$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            212,
            732,
            235
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例9：已知 $\\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + 3r(t) = 2\\frac{d}{dt} e(t), r(0_{-}) = 1, e(t) = u(t)$ ，求 $r(0_{+})$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            309,
            759,
            334
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 10: $r'(t) + 3r(t) = 2e'(t)$ , $e(t) = u(t)$ , $r(0_{-}) = 1$ , 求 $r(0_{+})$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            412,
            700,
            429
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】将 $r'(t)$ 和 $r(t)$ 代入方程的目的在于提醒勿忘方程中系数的影响，",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            783,
            803,
            799
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "实际只关注求解项所在表达式中 $\\Delta u(t)$ 前系数即可。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            807,
            589,
            824
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "官网：tongxinkaoyan.com",
        "bbox": [
            157,
            881,
            373,
            897
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
