    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、冲激函数匹配法列写—自由项中 $\\delta(t)$ 最高阶包含在响应最高阶中",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            715,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "①列写响应最高阶导数项方程，列到出现 $\\Delta u(t)$ 为止；",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            135,
            605,
            150
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "②对①式依次求积分，出现 $\\Delta u(t)$ 为止；",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            157,
            502,
            176
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "③纵向列写到响应原型为止。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            182,
            421,
            201
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 11: $r'(t) + 3r(t) = 3\\delta'(t)$ , $r(0_{-}) = 2$ , $r(0_{+}) = ?$",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            231,
            603,
            249
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【推导过程】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            257,
            294,
            273
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【书写过程】",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            466,
            292,
            483
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 12: 描述某LTI系统的微分方程为",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            627,
            475,
            642
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\ny ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 2 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + y (t) = f ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 2 f (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            349,
            650,
            643,
            669
        ],
        "page_idx": 4
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "已知 $y(0_{-})=1,\\quad y'(0_{-})=-1,\\quad f(t)=u(t),\\quad$ 求 $y(0_{+})$ 和 $y'(0_{+})$ 。",
        "bbox": [
